Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:06.25,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}満たされないままだった
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:08.93,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}独りよがりの emotion
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.06,0:02:12.48,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}はぐらかすように bringin' on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:13.86,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}風を切って
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:16.68,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}失うものなんてない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.73,0:02:19.31,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}守るべきものもない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.44,0:02:23.85,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}遠吠えはいつか青い空に fly away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:25.61,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}Just tell me everything
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.61,0:02:28.69,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}答えを探しながら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:31.89,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}たとえ無謀だと言われても
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.89,0:02:33.76,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}構わない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.76,0:02:36.40,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}今扉を開けるんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:39.29,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}起死回生望んだ future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.45,0:02:44.17,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}手を伸ばして手繰り寄せる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.27,0:02:46.07,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}This is my revolution
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.07,0:02:49.72,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}ただつき進んでくだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.85,0:02:55.54,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}運命さえ片っ端から get out of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:56.86,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}I gotta do it alright
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:02:58.15,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}根拠も何もない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.15,0:03:00.78,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}行く手を阻む奴は皆 no more chance
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:01.93,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}似ても似つかない
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.93,0:03:03.39,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}ヒーローに成り上がれ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.39,0:03:06.10,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}笑え 共に prove my soul yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:08.93,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}誰かを守る強さを
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:11.60,op jp,,0,0,0,,この心臓に宿して
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:16.70,op jp,,0,0,0,,綱渡りのように climb to the top
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:06.25,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}一直都没有得到满足
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:08.93,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}总是自以为是的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.06,0:02:12.48,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}一直躁动仿佛要破碎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:13.86,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}风驰电掣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:16.68,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}感觉已经没有什么可以失去的了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.73,0:02:19.31,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}也没有什么应该守护的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.44,0:02:23.85,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}呐喊总有一天要在这晴空之下 高飞远方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:25.61,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}只告诉我你的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.61,0:02:28.69,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}一起去寻找那个答案
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:31.89,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}即便被说成鲁莽
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.89,0:02:33.76,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.76,0:02:36.40,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}现在打开内心封锁的门扉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:39.29,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}希望那消失的未来能够重新明亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.45,0:02:44.17,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}伸出手让我们走在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.27,0:02:46.07,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}这就是我的革命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.07,0:02:49.72,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}只需要与我一起同行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.85,0:02:55.54,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}就算命运也要在这一端开始让路
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:56.86,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}我必须去做到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:02:58.15,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}没有任何的依据
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.15,0:03:00.78,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}阻挡去路的人都不可能得逞到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:01.93,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}似乎但也不如
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.93,0:03:03.39,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}成为那个顶点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.39,0:03:06.10,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}共同欢笑 证明我的内心是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:08.93,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}想要守护某人的坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:11.60,op zh,,0,0,0,,就寄宿在这颗心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:16.70,op zh,,0,0,0,,就仿佛是在走钢丝一般 达到那个山顶
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.82,0:22:04.03,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}good bye これまでの僕よ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.91,0:22:08.49,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}少しは強くなれたかい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.03,0:22:13.14,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}いつも始まりは信じることから
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.21,0:22:16.71,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}やるべきことは知ってる
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.51,0:22:28.60,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}good luck これからの僕よ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.60,0:22:32.81,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}要らぬプライドは放して
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.67,0:22:37.54,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}無くせぬものを拳に込めたら
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.61,0:22:40.82,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}自分のことを知れる？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.64,0:22:49.43,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}oh oh oh 眠らない心
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.49,0:22:55.46,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}oh oh oh 時は満ちたぞ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.20,0:22:57.98,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}I will rock me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.04,0:23:03.82,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}いつだって It’s myself 唱えてる
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.88,0:23:06.07,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}そんな僕もまた
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.13,0:23:09.86,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}迷いが増え 涙も枯れ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.93,0:23:14.49,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}怖くても 震える掌を
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.56,0:23:18.54,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}強く握って ライオンになって
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.60,0:23:21.69,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}全てを守れるか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.82,0:22:04.03,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}就此别过 从前的我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.91,0:22:08.49,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}是否已变得足够坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.03,0:22:13.14,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}万物始于坚信的初心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.21,0:22:16.71,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}心中早知道使命何方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.51,0:22:28.60,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}请多珍重 未来的我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.60,0:22:32.81,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}放下那不必要的骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.67,0:22:37.54,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}将无法割舍之物紧握
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.61,0:22:40.82,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}能否看清楚自我模样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.64,0:22:49.43,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}oh oh oh 永不沉睡的心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.49,0:22:55.46,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}oh oh oh 时机已然成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.20,0:22:57.98,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}我将撼动自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.04,0:23:03.82,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}始终呐喊着 It's myself
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.88,0:23:06.07,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}即便这样的我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.13,0:23:09.86,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}也会困惑丛生 泪流至涸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.93,0:23:14.49,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}仍要攥紧颤抖的双手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.56,0:23:18.54,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}紧紧握住 化身雄狮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.60,0:23:21.69,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}能否守护所有光芒
